<title>USA: MBIA lists capacity for N.Y., Calif. bond issuers.</title>
<headline>MBIA lists capacity for N.Y., Calif. bond issuers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Wednesday it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for the following credits:</p>
<p>--N.Y. State Dormitory Authority, New York City courts.</p>
<p>--New York City general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--New York City Industrial Development Authority, Terminal One Group Associates.</p>
<p>--New York City Municipal Water Finance Authority.</p>
<p>--Southern California Public Power, Power Verde.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
